<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head"><view class="row"><text class="page-title">企业账户</text><text class="demo-badge">模拟身份</text></view><view class="page-sub">贡献、协作和服务记录</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="load-error"><text>{{loadError}}</text><button class="secondary compact" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><view wx:if="{{!ready && !loadError}}" class="panel"><view class="skeleton large"/><view class="skeleton short"/></view>
  <block wx:if="{{ready}}">
    <view class="surface-frame"><view class="surface-inner"><view class="account-heading"><image class="account-avatar" src="/assets/brand/logo.png"/><view class="grow"><view class="account-title">{{selected.name}}</view><view class="list-note">生物城共享冷链演示企业</view></view></view><view class="account-stats"><view class="account-stat"><view class="account-label">贡献积分</view><view class="account-value number">{{selected.points}}</view></view><view class="account-stat"><view class="account-label">保底库容</view><view class="account-value number">{{selected.guarantee}}<text class="unit">m³</text></view></view></view><picker class="space" range="{{companyNames}}" value="{{selectedIndex}}" bindchange="company"><button class="secondary" hover-class="press"><image class="icon icon-s" src="/assets/icons/swap.png"/>切换模拟企业</button></picker></view></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">共享收益</text><text class="section-note">模拟已结算</text></view><view class="panel"><view class="row"><view><view class="resource-number number">{{sharedIncome}}<text class="unit">元</text></view><view class="list-note">仓储与车辆共享收入（含应急）</view></view><view class="icon-well teal"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/support.png"/></view></view><view class="divider"/><button class="secondary" hover-class="press" bindtap="rules">{{showRules ? '收起积分与分成规则' : '查看积分与分成规则'}}</button><view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="rules-panel space">冷库投放：库容×天数×温区系数（冷藏1.0／冷冻1.3）。应急协作：履约后追加供给方收益的5%积分。<br/>车辆共享：每批完成后，按台次×里程×温控系数计入演示积分；仓储和运输费用按供给方80%、平台20%分配，积分12个月有效。<br/>费用与积分仅供演示，不涉及真实支付或兑换。</view></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">常用服务</text></view><view class="list"><button class="menu-button" hover-class="tap-surface" bindtap="alliance"><view class="menu-label"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/shield.png"/>积分与共享服务</view><image class="menu-chevron" src="/assets/icons/arrow.png"/></button><button class="menu-button" hover-class="tap-surface" bindtap="orders"><view class="menu-label"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/orders-active.png"/>我的预约记录</view><image class="menu-chevron" src="/assets/icons/arrow.png"/></button><button class="menu-button" hover-class="tap-surface" bindtap="resources"><view class="menu-label"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/resource-active.png"/>查看与发布资源</view><image class="menu-chevron" src="/assets/icons/arrow.png"/></button><button class="menu-button" hover-class="tap-surface" bindtap="about"><view class="menu-label"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/info.png"/>平台与数据说明</view><image class="menu-chevron" src="/assets/icons/arrow.png"/></button></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">最近操作</text></view><view class="list"><view wx:for="{{recentEvents}}" wx:key="id" class="log-item">{{item.message}}</view><view wx:if="{{!recentEvents.length}}" class="empty"><text class="muted small">完成预约或协作后，这里会留下记录</text></view></view>
  </block>
  <view class="tool-panel"><button class="danger" hover-class="press" bindtap="reset">恢复演示数据</button><view class="demo-foot">渝冷智享 · 比赛演示版<br/>{{mode === 'local' ? '数据保存在本机' : '独立云端工作区'}}，不代表真实企业认证</view></view>
</view>
